OL,3,AMarseille braces for more unrest after
OL,4,Aprotests give way to 'apocalyptic'
OL,5,Adisorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FThunder and lightning have boomed
OL,8,Facross Marseille following the
OL,9,Fweekend's mayhem, illuminating the
OL,10,Fcracked windows and boarded-up doors of
OL,11,Fhundreds of businesses that were
OL,12,Fsmashed as protests gave way to
OL,13,Fdisorder.
OL,15,FFrance's second city saw some of the
OL,16,Fworst violence as chaos gripped the
OL,17,Fcountry on Saturday. Local business
OL,18,Fleaders say more than 500 premises were
OL,19,Fdamaged, and the majority looted.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
